/**
 * First-run seeding.
 *
 * A brand-new organisation gets a working workspace rather than an empty one:
 * tools, assistants with prompts and knowledge, numbers, and a history of calls
 * generated by running the real agent runtime against scripted callers.
 *
 * That last part matters — the transcripts, intents, tool calls, latencies and
 * costs on the dashboard are produced here by the same code path a live call
 * uses, so nothing on screen is a decorative fixture.
 */

